id: pm-jev-qriu
title: Compact decision output for agent context budgets
description: "Round default decision output to three decimals and retain top three choice options plus the selected option; preserve full precision and options for JSON and full. Follow-up to triage, dedupe and ask implementation."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[1]: "pkg:pm-jev"
created_at: "2026-10-05T06:12:33.466Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-05T06:24:17.457Z"
author: codex-sol
parent: pm-jev-0w3q
release: 2026.10.5
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-05T06:12:55.405Z",codex-sol,"TDD plan: exercise triage, dedupe, mixed ask and gate compact output, top-three ties and selected-option retention, omitted_options counts, empty dedupe, full/JSON/output-format=json preservation, and unchanged two-decimal receipts. Pinned host reserved flags exclude full; register one shared full flag for the four commands. Measure the same live crash triage receipt through the host TOON renderer before and after."
  "2026-10-05T06:16:10.893Z",codex-sol,"Red phase: linked agent UX tests failed as expected because default probabilities and confidence were unrounded. Live tev1:4b crash-report triage baseline: 1035 TOON bytes including the renderer newline, 11 configured item types. Saved the full receipt for an identical-response comparison after formatting changes."
  "2026-10-05T06:18:50.886Z",codex-sol,"Default release-note generation selects only closed items, but orchestrator rules require these implementations to remain in progress. Make changelog generation/check/release-note status selection consistently include closed,in_progress so pending implementations are visible without closing tracker items or disabling drift checking."
  "2026-10-05T06:20:13.038Z",codex-sol,"Byte comparison correction: formatBuiltInOutput already includes a trailing newline; the initial 1035-byte capture added an extra blank line. Exact host-rendered crash triage output is 1034 bytes before and 574 bytes after (460 bytes saved, 44.5%). Replayed the same saved live tev1:4b receipt through the real command harness and built-in TOON formatter to exclude inference variability: 11 choices become 3 with omitted_options=8."
  "2026-10-05T06:21:37.491Z",codex-sol,"Strengthened regressions after baseline gates: verify dedupe retains exact SDK similarity 2/3 in JSON/full and rounds it to 0.667 in compact output. Extend packed CLI acceptance to parse full and expect false flags through the actual host, asserting compact TOON omissions, complete full output, and real secret/clean process exits."
  "2026-10-05T06:23:47.693Z",codex-sol,"Verification complete: 88/88 tests pass; c8 statements/lines 2599/2599, branches 533/533, functions 63/63 (100/100/100/100), nine source files including scripts. Typecheck and test compilation pass, lint passes, duplication 0%, docstrings 139/139. Real local live and packed npm/Bun CLI acceptance pass (including full and safety exits). Strict source-worktree PM health passes with zero findings; linked PM health also passes after selecting tracker context instead of the empty schema fixture. Production audit, pack dry run, changelog drift check and publish-attestation checks pass. Tracker test-result tracking is disabled, so PM comments and docs carry receipts. Remaining risk: bounded synthetic evidence does not establish calibrated production accuracy; existing hosted/calibration items remain deferred."
  "2026-10-05T06:24:17.457Z",codex-sol,"Final coverage receipt correction: the latest c8 report counts 532/532 branches, with 2599/2599 statements/lines and 63/63 functions. The earlier successful run counted 533/533 branches; both enforce all four 100% dimensions. docs/agent-ux-validation.md uses the final report."
